   "source": [
    "# Employee Attrition Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "Employee turnover is a major challenge for organizations, as losing employees can increase recruitment costs and affect overall productivity. Understanding the factors associated with employee attrition can help organizations identify potential risks and make better retention decisions.\n",
    "\n",
    "In this project, exploratory data analysis was performed to identify patterns and factors related to employee attrition. A Logistic Regression model was developed to predict whether an employee is likely to leave the company based on different personal, job-related, and satisfaction features.\n",
    "\n",
    "Logistic Regression was selected as the main model due to its interpretability, allowing better understanding of how different factors influence the likelihood of employee attrition."
   ]
  },
